	- File Access Management :::
	
	    -rw-rw-r-- 1 ubuntu ubuntu    0 Oct 19 15:34 s3
		
		----------
		
		-									# Denote dir or file (Possible value:  d or - )
												'd'  Denotes Directory
												'-'  Denotes File 
												
												
		 ---								# Denote the Owner Level Access 
												Possible Values: r / w / x 
												r - Read only Access 
												w - Write Access 
												x - Execute Access 
		
			---								# Denote the Group Level Access
												Possible Values: r / w / x 
												r - Read only Access 
												w - Write Access 
												x - Execute Access

			   ---							# Denote the Public User Level Access
												Possible Values: r / w / x 
												r - Read only Access 
												w - Write Access 
												x - Execute Access			
		
